<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>SkillBridge — Skills, not just certificates</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="css">
</head>
<body>

<header class="nav" id="siteNav">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a href="#top" class="logo">SkillBridge<span class="dot">.</span></a>

    <nav class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <a href="#personas">Portals</a>
      <a href="#pathway">Why SkillBridge</a>
      <a href="#how">How it works</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
      <div class="nav-cta">
        <a href="#account" class="btn btn-ghost" data-account-tab="login">Log in</a>
        <a href="#account" class="btn btn-primary" data-account-tab="signup">Create account</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <button class="hamburger" id="hamburgerBtn" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </button>
  </div>
</header>

<main>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero" id="top">
    <p class="hero-eyebrow">For future-ready talent</p>
    <h1 class="hero-title">SKILLBRIDGE<span class="dot">.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Build <mark>real skills</mark>, identify <mark>skill gaps</mark>, and connect with <mark>verified career paths</mark> before everyone else catches up.</p>

    <div class="hero-photo-wrap">
      <img src="images/student_split.png" alt="Student skill journey illustration" class="hero-photo">
    </div>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" id="assessBtn">ASSESS MY SKILLS</button>
      <button class="btn btn-hero-green" id="explorePortalsBtn">ACCESS PORTALS / GET VERIFIED ⚡</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ACCOUNT: LOG IN / CREATE ACCOUNT -->
  <section class="account" id="account">
    <div class="account-card">
      <div class="account-tabs" role="tablist">
        <button class="account-tab active" data-tab="login" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Log in</button>
        <button class="account-tab" data-tab="signup" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Create account</button>
      </div>

      <form class="account-form" id="loginForm" data-panel="login">
        <label for="loginUsername">Username</label>
        <input type="text" id="loginUsername" name="username" placeholder="Enter your username" autocomplete="username" required>

        <label for="loginPassword">Password</label>
        <input type="password" id="loginPassword" name="password" placeholder="Enter your password" autocomplete="current-password" required>

        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg account-submit">Log in</button>
        <p class="account-note" id="loginNote"></p>
      </form>

      <form class="account-form" id="signupForm" data-panel="signup" hidden>
        <label for="signupUsername">Username</label>
        <input type="text" id="signupUsername" name="username" placeholder="Choose a username" autocomplete="username" required>

        <label for="signupPassword">Password</label>
        <input type="password" id="signupPassword" name="password" placeholder="Choose a password" autocomplete="new-password" required>

        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg account-submit">Create account</button>
        <p class="account-note" id="signupNote"></p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PERSONA SWITCHER -->
  <section class="personas" id="personas">
    <div class="section-head">

      <h2>One platform. Three very different Monday mornings.</h2>
      <p>Tap a role to see what changes for them.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="persona-tabs" id="personaTabs" role="tablist">
      <button class="persona-tab active" data-role="student" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Student</button>
 <button class="persona-tab" data-role="academician" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Academician</button>
      <button class="persona-tab" data-role="industry" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Industry</button>
    </div>

    <div class="persona-panel">
      <img id="personaImg" class="persona-image-full" src="images/student_split.png" alt="Split illustration showing a student's worries next to the SkillBridge solution">
      <div class="persona-text" hidden>
        <h3 id="personaHeadline"></h3>
        <ul id="personaProblems"></ul>
        <ul id="personaSolutions"></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- PATHWAY -->
  <section class="pathway" id="pathway">
    <div class="section-head light">
      <p class="eyebrow">Old system isn't built for today</p>
      <h2>Prepare for a stronger tomorrow</h2>
      <p>Bridging the gap between academia, industry and students — because the future needs skilled, job-ready talent.</p>
    </div>
    <img class="pathway-img" src="images/path-comparison.png" alt="Comparison of the traditional certificate-based path against the SkillBridge skill-first path">
  </section>

  <!-- FLOW -->
  <section class="flow" id="how">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>How a skill becomes an opportunity</h2>
      <p>The same pipeline runs underneath all three portals.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="flow-steps">
      <li><span class="flow-num">01</span><div><h4>Take the skill assessment</h4><p>Adaptive, role-aware, no certificates required to start.</p></div></li>
      <li><span class="flow-num">02</span><div><h4>Get your verified skill profile</h4><p>What you can actually do, laid out clearly.</p></div></li>
      <li><span class="flow-num">03</span><div><h4>See your skill gaps</h4><p>Matched against the role or requirement you're aiming for.</p></div></li>
      <li><span class="flow-num">04</span><div><h4>Follow a mapped learning path</h4><p>Training and mentorship built around the gap, not guesswork.</p></div></li>
      <li><span class="flow-num">05</span><div><h4>Match with real opportunities</h4><p>Internships, projects and jobs filtered by verified competency.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="faq" id="faq">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Questions people ask before joining</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-list" id="faqList">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q">
          <span>What is SkillBridge, in one line?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>A platform that turns verified skills — not just certificates — into learning paths and career opportunities for students, academicians and industry.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q">
          <span>Is this only for engineering or CS students?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>No. Any student who wants their real skills recognised — across streams — can build a profile and take a role-based assessment.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q">
          <span>How does SkillBridge actually verify a skill?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>Through structured, role-based assessments and demonstrated project work, rather than relying on a certificate alone.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q">
          <span>What does an academician get out of this?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>Live visibility into the skills industry is actually hiring for, plus mentorship and training links to help align curriculum.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q">
          <span>How is this better than sorting resumes manually?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>Recruiters filter and match on verified skill data instead of reading hundreds of similar-looking resumes and certificates.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q">
          <span>Do I need existing projects or certificates to join?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>No. The assessment is the starting point — your skill profile and gap map are built from there.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

